l General Universitario Morales Meseguer is a healthcare institution located in Murcia, specializing in various medical fields including endocrinology and nutrition.", "YAMINA SULEIMAN MARTOS:Dra. Yamina Suleiman Martos is a specialist in endocrinology and nutrition, involved in the clinical management of diabetes and related conditions.", "MURCIA:Murcia is an autonomous community in Spain known for its diverse healthcare and educational initiatives. It is home to the Hospital General Universitario Morales Meseguer, which serves the local population's medical needs. In 2003, Murcia hosted the National Congress on Pediatric Nutrition, highlighting its commitment to addressing nutritional issues within the community. Additionally, in this region, patients are required to submit a justification report to continue receiving treatment for their nutritional needs, reflecting the structured approach to healthcare management in Murcia.", "MNGIE:MNGIE, or mitochondrial neurogastrointestinal encephalomyopathy, is a rare genetic disorder characterized by a deficiency in thymidine phosphorylase, which is caused by mutations in the TYMP gene. This disorder primarily affects the gastrointestinal and nervous systems, resulting in a range of metabolic issues and complications, including diabetes. Due to the complexity of the symptoms and the interplay between the affected systems, MNGIE requires intricate treatment approaches to manage its severe manifestations.", "NUTRICIONAL SUPPLEMENTS:Nutritional supplements are products taken to enhance dietary intake, often used in clinical settings to support patients with specific health conditions.", "SUPLEMENTOS VITAMÍNICOS:Suplementos vitamínicos are dietary products designed to provide essential vitamins that may be lacking in an individual's diet. These supplements are particularly beneficial for cancer patients, as they help to address specific vitamin deficiencies that may arise due to their health condition. Overall, vitamin supplements serve as a valuable resource for individuals seeking to enhance their nutritional intake and support their health.", "NEUROPATÍA ÓPTICA BILATERAL:La neuropatía óptica bilateral es un diagnóstico que se presenta a los 10-12 años, caracterizado por la disminución progresiva de la agudeza visual y la atrofia óptica observada en el fondo de ojo.", "POLINEUROPATÍA SENSITIVO MOTORA AXONAL:La polineuropatía sensitivo motora axonal es un diagnóstico que se presenta a los 16 años, caracterizado por debilidad progresiva en miembros y amiotrofia distal.", "HIPOACUSIA PROFUNDA BILATERAL:La hipoacusia profunda bilateral neurosensorial es un diagnóstico que se presenta a los 30 años, que requiere la colocación de un implante coclear debido a la severidad de la pérdida auditiva.", "LEUCOENCEFALOPATÍA SUPRATENTORIAL:La leucoencefalopatía supratentorial periventricular difusa es un hallazgo observado en la resonancia magnética nuclear cerebral, indicando cambios en la sustancia blanca del cerebro.", "SÍNTOMAS DIGESTIVOS:Los síntomas digestivos incluyen pérdida de peso, deposiciones blandas y episodios diarreicos, que se presentan en el paciente a lo largo del tiempo."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}